| 10000 |  100 | 0.01000 | 0.01000 | 0.01% |

ML-DSA Parameter Analysis:

ML-DSA-44:
  γ1 = 131072, β = 78
  Per-coefficient rejection: 0.000595
  Total coefficients: 1024
  Vector rejection prob: 0.4564
  Expected attempts (z only): 1.84

ML-DSA-65:
