ML-DSA-87:
  γ1 = 524288, β = 120
  Per-coefficient rejection: 0.000229
  Total coefficients: 1792
  Vector rejection prob: 0.3365
  Expected attempts (z only): 1.51

Effect of γ1 on Expected Attempts:

(Fixed: β = 196, n = 256, l = 5)

| γ1 | β/γ1 | Vector Reject | E[attempts] |
|----------|---------|---------------|-------------|
|   262144 | 0.000748 | 0.6161 | 2.60 |
|   524288 | 0.000374 | 0.3804 | 1.61 |
|  1048576 | 0.000187 | 0.2128 | 1.27 |
|  2097152 | 0.000093 | 0.1128 | 1.13 |

Key insight: Larger γ1 reduces rejections but increases signature size
(more bits needed to encode z coefficients).
